<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 229 0 R
/E (Learning topics. Week 1 introduced the CAD working environment, planes, the origin and the sketch workflow. The key ideas were sketch entities, dimensions, geometric constraints and sketch status. A central habit taught in this week was to anchor the sketch to the origin first, so that the sketch never floats and can reach the Fully Defined \(all-black\) state.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
